{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":140,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1918585,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":289858,"Name":"pamib","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1522340607,"LastPoster":{"Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1918585,"PostDate":1522340607,"PostContent":"Are you wearing shoes sandals or going barefoot that sand could be hot?","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pamibach@gmail.com","IpAddress":"12.104.47.252","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1521943231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"pamib","Id":289858,"Name":"pamib","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.104.47.252","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81242,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c608b8d9fed1f583c65bc7bc496da66","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Are you wearing shoes sandals or going barefoot that sand could be hot?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918585,"PostDate":1522340607,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Are you wearing shoes sandals or going barefoot that sand could be hot?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pamibach@gmail.com","IpAddress":"12.104.47.252","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1521943231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"pamib","Id":289858,"Name":"pamib","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.151.28.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81242,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4313cdb26fa82ca76e597b8dbb864a44","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I had cute heels for photos, then cute\/dressier styled flip flops for the rest of the day and comfort LOL. But since my ceremony was on the beach, I ended up going barefoot and it was totally fine. Hot sand will really depend on the time and location of your ceremony! :) Lots of ceremony sites on the sand will also have a runner -- ask your resort planner about whether going barefoot would be a problem, they would be able to give you best insight!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918594,"PostDate":1522788627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I had cute heels for photos, then cute\/dressier styled flip flops for the rest of the day and comfort LOL. But since my ceremony was on the beach, I ended up going barefoot and it was totally fine. Hot sand will really depend on the time and location of your ceremony! <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Lots of ceremony sites on the sand will also have a runner -- ask your resort planner about whether going barefoot would be a problem, they would be able to give you best insight!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285954345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"81242","Title":"What Are You Wearing On Your Feet?","LastPostDate":1522788627},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
