{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":469,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1918199,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":289392,"Name":"katinabag","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1507326387,"LastPoster":{"Id":289858,"Name":"pamib","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1918199,"PostDate":1507326387,"PostContent":"Hello everyone,  I am getting married in few months. My fiance and I have decided to tie the knot...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoahatrinh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"116.108.80.17","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1507325749,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"katinabag","Id":289392,"Name":"katinabag","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"116.108.80.17","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81144,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by katinabag, 06 October 2017 - 01:48 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1507326484,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a410611e63a5ed1704ac1fdcea936750","RawContent":"Hello everyone, \n\nI am getting married in few months. My fiance and I have decided to tie the knot on a beach. The thing is he is really into the idea of me wearing my traditional dress on our wedding day, while many of my friends just go against it as they said it looks way too formal for such a care-free wedding style. I&#039;m really confused right now and need your opinions! Please tell me what you think about the dress (I post a picture here). Do you really think it is not suitable for a beach ceremony? Please help me... Thank you \ud83c\udf37","Attachments":[{"Id":36874,"Name":"FB_IMG_1497415522206.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2017\/post-289392-0-58333600-1507326294.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2017\/post-289392-0-58333600-1507326294_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":1200}],"Id":1918199,"PostDate":1507326387,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello everyone, <br>\nI am getting married in few months. My fiance and I have decided to tie the knot on a beach. The thing is he is really into the idea of me wearing my traditional dress on our wedding day, while many of my friends just go against it as they said it looks way too formal for such a care-free wedding style. I'm really confused right now and need your opinions! Please tell me what you think about the dress (I post a picture here). Do you really think it is not suitable for a beach ceremony? Please help me... Thank you \ud83c\udf37\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoahatrinh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"116.108.80.17","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1507325749,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"katinabag","Id":289392,"Name":"katinabag","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.151.28.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81144,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a021889d21b4e74e085739cab364485","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That is a beautiful wedding gown and I think if it&#039;s what you want to wear, then you should! While some people have an idea of what a beach wedding gown should look like, it&#039;s ultimately up to you to make your wedding vision come to life. Since your gown is fairly covered up and has sleeves, depending on where you&#039;re getting married at, just keep in mind you may get very hot especially if you&#039;re getting married in a location with high temps and lots of humidity -- this could lead to lots of sweating, which will show in your photos. But again it really depends on your location, time of year and most importantly, what you want :) Hope this helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918202,"PostDate":1507575909,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That is a beautiful wedding gown and I think if it's what you want to wear, then you should! While some people have an idea of what a beach wedding gown should look like, it's ultimately up to you to make your wedding vision come to life. Since your gown is fairly covered up and has sleeves, depending on where you're getting married at, just keep in mind you may get very hot especially if you're getting married in a location with high temps and lots of humidity -- this could lead to lots of sweating, which will show in your photos. But again it really depends on your location, time of year and most importantly, what you want <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Hope this helps!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285954345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.242.249.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81144,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2aee046fe59bf344973812633437f00a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Your dress is gorgeous, I wouldn&#039;t change it.&amp;nbsp; Very unique, it looks lightweight so I don&#039;t see a problem wearing it on the beach!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m also getting married on the beach and found a lightweight lace dress and I love it.......you need to wear what you feel beautiful in!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918330,"PostDate":1513141149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Your dress is gorgeous, I wouldn't change it.\u00a0 Very unique, it looks lightweight so I don't see a problem wearing it on the beach!\u00a0 I'm also getting married on the beach and found a lightweight lace dress and I love it.......you need to wear what you feel beautiful in!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>June 01, 2009, Nassau Bahamas<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/community.theknot.com\/cs\/ks\/user\/page.aspx?username=sumrdream\">My Planning Bio<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"eshier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.242.249.220","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1209434185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209220.jpg?_r=1513140369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":174,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sumrdream","Id":209220,"Name":"sumrdream","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"112.196.79.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81144,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3be5e7af558a74fcecef62c98cddb766","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You&#039;s dress really beautiful and you also look gorgeous in it. So just do which you want to do, because it&#039;s your special day. Ignore others comments.......&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918364,"PostDate":1514465409,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You's dress really beautiful and you also look gorgeous in it. So just do which you want to do, because it's your special day. Ignore others comments.......<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stevenhenry018@gmail.com","IpAddress":"112.196.79.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1507290897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"stevenhenry018","Id":289390,"Name":"stevenhenry018","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.104.47.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81144,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76cb4486322a4673bbba263f45e4d3ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That is a beautiful dress, and if you don&#039;t mind wearing it on sand, then by all means wear it, is it comfortable, lightweight and make you feel pretty? there you go it&#039;s up to you.congratulations on your upcoming wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p  class=\"\" style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(164,164,164);\"&gt;Posted&amp;nbsp;Today, 03:36 PM&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That is a beautiful dress, and if you don&#039;t mind wearing it on sand, then by all means wear it, is it comfortable, lightweight and make you feel pretty? there you go it&#039;s up to you.congratulations on your upcoming wedding&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1918591,"PostDate":1522618690,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That is a beautiful dress, and if you don't mind wearing it on sand, then by all means wear it, is it comfortable, lightweight and make you feel pretty? there you go it's up to you.congratulations on your upcoming wedding!<\/p>\n<br \/><p  class=\"\"  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(164,164,164)\">Posted\u00a0Today, 03:36 PM<\/p>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\n<p>That is a beautiful dress, and if you don't mind wearing it on sand, then by all means wear it, is it comfortable, lightweight and make you feel pretty? there you go it's up to you.congratulations on your upcoming wedding<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pamibach@gmail.com","IpAddress":"12.104.47.252","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1521943231,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"pamib","Id":289858,"Name":"pamib","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"81144","Title":"Please Help With Beach Wedding Dress!","LastPostDate":1522618690},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
